varq-sqlparser
==============

This directory is a vendored copy of sqlparser-rs, the Apache DataFusion SQL parser:

    https://github.com/apache/datafusion-sqlparser-rs
    crate: sqlparser 0.62.0
    commit: 3dd0e30d8bb1d2a6775f62d2b84839b60133effb

It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE.TXT in this directory), and is used
here under that licence. sqlparser-rs is developed by the Apache DataFusion project; the copyright
in its source is held by its contributors, as recorded in the headers of each file.

MODIFICATIONS
-------------

At the time of vendoring, the source under `src/` is identical to the published crate. Any file
changed after that point carries a notice at the top of the file saying so, as the licence requires
(section 4(b)). The list of changed files, and why, is kept in README.md alongside this notice.

This copy is renamed `varq-sqlparser` so that a modified version never presents itself as the
original. Apache-2.0 grants no rights to the project's names or trademarks (section 6), and none are
claimed.
